<section class="ap-bloque"><div class="envoltura"><div class="ap-app"><p><b>In the app, “For you” picks guides for you:</b> the ones for the decks you play and for your hardest matchup.</p><a class="boton prim" href="#descargar"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v11m0 0-4.5-4.5M12 15l4.5-4.5M5 20h14"></path></svg><span>Download free</span></a></div></div></section>
