<section class="seccion" id="descargar"><div class="envoltura"><div class="apoyo uno"><div>
<div class="eti">Free download</div>
<h2>These guides, inside ManaLab</h2>
<p>ManaLab saves your Arena and Magic Online games and, in “Learn”, shows you the guides that match what you play.</p>
<p>Requirements: Windows 10 or 11. Unzip the file and open ManaLab.exe. Nothing to install.</p>
<p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="boton prim descarga" href="https://github.com/EusebioG96/ManaLab/releases/download/v{{VERSION}}/ManaLab-{{VERSION}}-portable.zip" download data-descarga data-goatcounter-click="{{EVENTO:descarga}}" data-goatcounter-title="{{EVENTO:descarga}}" id="enlace-descarga" rel="noopener"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v11m0 0-4.5-4.5M12 15l4.5-4.5M5 20h14"></path></svg><span>Download free</span></a></p>
<p class="nota-descarga">Version <span data-version>{{VERSION}}</span> · ZIP · <a href="https://github.com/EusebioG96/ManaLab/releases" rel="noopener">other versions</a></p>
<template id="bloque-movil"><div class="movil-caja">
<h4 class="movil-tit">ManaLab runs on your computer</h4>
{{CORREO_MOVIL txt="Send yourself the link and download it there."}}
<p><button class="boton prim" data-compartir data-copiado="Link copied" data-titulo="{{EVENTO:compartir-movil}}" data-url="https://manalab.es/learn/" type="button"><span>Send me the link</span></button></p>
<p class="movil-zip"><a href="https://github.com/EusebioG96/ManaLab/releases/download/v{{VERSION}}/ManaLab-{{VERSION}}-portable.zip" download data-descarga data-titulo="{{EVENTO:descarga-movil}}" rel="noopener">Download the ZIP anyway</a></p>
<p aria-live="polite" class="movil-estado" role="status"></p>
</div></template>
<p class="nota-smartscreen" data-solo-pc>Before unzipping, right-click the ZIP › Properties › tick <b>Unblock</b> › OK. If a warning still appears, click <b>More info › Run anyway</b>.</p>
<p class="nota-smartscreen"><a href="/safety/">Is it safe? Check it yourself →</a></p>
</div></div></div></section>
